  "title": "Register dcap-ultrahonk-v1 UltraHonk Verification Key",
  "summary": "# Register dcap-ultrahonk-v1 UltraHonk Verification Key\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis proposal registers the `dcap-ultrahonk-v1` UltraHonk (Barretenberg) verification key in the XION mainnet zk module. It completes the mainnet verifier prerequisite identified in proposal 61 (Store Dossier Contract Code): Dossier's attestation-verifying execute paths call `/xion.zk.v1.Query/ProofVerifyUltraHonk` with this key name, which cannot succeed until the key is registered on mainnet.\n\n## Key Details\n\n- Name: `dcap-ultrahonk-v1`\n- Proof system: `PROOF_SYSTEM_ULTRA_HONK_ZK` (Barretenberg UltraHonk ZK variant)\n- Raw key size: 3680 bytes\n- SHA-256: `e0a4e8c9c1cff52d4e9ea31bbce511d7796b5526b93c58ca40d2af8878371f38`\n- Circuit: Noir DCAP quote verification, 21-field public-input layout with tcb_eval + qe_eval split and intersected validity window\n\n## Provenance\n\nThe key bytes are byte-identical to the verification key registered on `xion-testnet-2` as vkey id 15 under the same name, where it is in active use by the testnet Dossier instance (`xion1xhulaw4ndwh595ycfmuc77svuhn4xek44qn9tqensstyr9xd0hfsaurswh`, code 2293).\n\n- Testnet registration transaction: https://explorer.testnet.burnt.com/verona/tx/2E3D7ADD59CC84B9AE1A52704A83846B7E01FF193EBCF7E48B9BA96992D4960C (height 16301711, 2026-06-24)\n\nTo verify, decode this proposal's `vkey_bytes` from base64 and compare its SHA-256 with the testnet key:\n\n```\ncurl -s https://api.xion-testnet-2.burnt.com/burnt/xion/zk/v1/vkeys/name/dcap-ultrahonk-v1 \\\n  | jq -r .vkey.key_bytes | base64 -d | sha256sum\n```\n\n## Scope\n\nThis proposal only registers the verification key. The message executes with the governance module account as authority, so future updates to or removal of this key also require governance. It does not instantiate the Dossier contract (mainnet code ID 68) and does not change zk module parameters.",
